        "node_id": "n_6_71a992",
        "thought_text": "Implement a more efficient algorithm by leveraging the fact that the optimal line will pass through at least two fruit centers. Iterate over all pairs of fruit centers and calculate the maximum number of fruits that can be sliced by a line passing through those centers.",
