        "node_id": "n_12_2d0a6a",
        "thought_text": "Utilize a different geometric property: for each fruit, calculate the set of lines that can pass through its center and intersect the boundary of other circles. Then, find the intersection of these sets to determine the lines that maximize the number of intersected circles.",
